post-it: Wants a good-looking screensaver
cause: No screensaver set
symptoms:
	Wants a screensaver
checks:
	yes: No screensaver set
		shows: Display Properties, Screen Saver: (None)
	no: Wallpaper is a picture of the desktop
	no: High contrast colour scheme
	no: Sound is muted
	yes: Picture is clean
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: Windows takes long to start
software steps:
	Display Properties, Screen Saver
	Pick 3D Pipes
	Apply
notes:
	"A good looking guy like me needs a good looking screensaver"
